              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2022-30580\nSeverity: high\nPackage: stdlib\nVersion: go1.16.5\nFix Version: 1.17.11,1.18.3\nType: go-module\nLocation: /usr/local/bin/kustomize\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2022-30580](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2022-30580)",
